<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-ZIMBABWE BEAT EASTERN CAPE XI BY 83 RUNS.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-ZIMBABWE BEAT EASTERN CAPE XI BY 83 RUNS.</headline>
<dateline>ALICE, South Africa 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Zimbabwe beat an</p>
<p>Eastern Cape X1 by 83 runs in a one-day (50 overs) cricket match</p>
<p>on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Scores: Zimbabwe 248-6 innings closed; Eastern Cape</p>
<p>Invitation X1 165 in 40 overs.</p>
</text>
